ó una nominación al Latin Grammy como Mejor Artista Nuevo.", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Piso_21", "cita": "Later in 2012, thanks to the success of their debut studio album Piso 21. The group was nominated for Best New Artist in the Latin Grammy Awards that same year."}]}
